; The one variable: `self_modulate = Color(0.5, 1, 0.5, 0.8)` on a Control with internal children. It
; reaches only the Control's own commands (`renderer_canvas_cull.cpp:268`): the box of a TextEdit, the
; arrows of a SpinBox. The parts that are child Controls or child canvas items draw without it. Another
; scene would not show a regression here: no other golden sets `self_modulate` on these Controls.

